| `check_N` template twin parity | Refuses an undeclared `*.jinja` twin, a parity twin that stops reproducing its file, a missing promised pyproject setting in either sibling, and malformed promise lists with one named error. | `make check` | [`template.twins.<path>`](settings.md#configprojectjson), [`template.required_settings`](settings.md#configprojectjson) | Silent without twins or promised settings, including in a generated project. It cannot render jinja, so it proves less than a render. | [deterministic-checks.md](../guides/deterministic-checks.md) | always |
